# JQuick agent capability plugins.
#
# Every line names one JQuickPlugin implementation. The file has two audiences:
#
#   1. the built-in capabilities of this jar, listed so that the discovery path runs on every
#      boot and cannot silently rot;
#   2. a third-party capability, which is added by dropping its own jar (with its own services
#      file) on the classpath - no change to this module is required.
#
# A provider MUST have a public no-argument constructor, because ServiceLoader creates it before
# any configuration exists. Configuration is read in JQuickPlugin#initialize, from the installed
# environment. A discovered name that collides with a built-in is ignored: a third-party jar must
# never be able to replace the tracer.

# --- observation -----------------------------------------------------------------
io.github.paohaijiao.jquick.agent.plugin.trace.JQuickTracePlugin
io.github.paohaijiao.jquick.agent.plugin.metrics.JQuickMetricsPlugin

# --- integrations ----------------------------------------------------------------
io.github.paohaijiao.jquick.agent.plugin.component.JQuickHttpPlugin
